# master instructions
Master_Instructions.pdf

# --- Data leak guard -------------------------------------------------------
# Block every dataset by default. Only the tiny anonymized starter slice ships.

# Never commit bulk dataset dumps or archives
*.parquet
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.feather

# --- Generated pipeline artifacts -----------------------------------------
# data/processed is regenerated by the pipeline
data/processed/
# outputs: keep the small committed examples (model_report.md, charts/,
# refresh_queue_sample.csv), ignore regenerated heavy artifacts

# --- Intern work area ------------------------------------------------------
# your experiments live in work/; datasets never enter git

# --- Python / notebooks ----------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
.env
*.pkl
*.pickle

# --- Solution preservation (author reference only, keeps student templates clean) ---
work/completed_reference/
work/build_notebooks.py
work/proposal_section4_timeline.md
work/MODEL_EXECUTION_GUIDE.md
work/MODEL_COMPETITION_GUIDE.md
